<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0 }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 1280, height: 720 }}>
    <Box style={{
      width: 1280, height: 44, background: '#F3F1E7', flexDirection: 'row',
      alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between',
      paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60,
    }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#2F4A2B', letterSpacing: 2, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>04　AI 判断一</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B8A7E', letterSpacing: 2 }}>MedAI</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 2, background: '#2F4A2B' }} />

    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 22, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1C1F1A', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
        个体化靠提示词装配，不做微调
      </Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#55544A', marginTop: 6 }}>
        同一个问题，"头晕"对 27 岁和 72 岁、对服降压药和不服药的人，答案是四件不同的事。
      </Text>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 586, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Image src="assets/consult.png" style={{ width: 586, height: 408, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 6, border: '1px solid #D8D4C4' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#8B8A7E', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            图 2　没有输入任何背景信息，回答里直接出现了患者姓名、年龄与在服药物
          </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 28 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2F4A2B', marginBottom: 10 }}>
            每次对话前拼四样东西
          </Text>

          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingBottom: 9 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 24, height: 24, borderRadius: 12, background: '#2F4A2B', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>1</Text></Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#33352E', marginLeft: 12, flex: 1 }}>
              档案：年龄 / 体型 / 血型 / 过敏史 / 病史 / 主诉
            </Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingBottom: 9 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 24, height: 24, borderRadius: 12, background: '#2F4A2B', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>2</Text></Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#33352E', marginLeft: 12, flex: 1 }}>
              在服药物：isActive 的药名、剂量、频次
            </Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingBottom: 9 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 24, height: 24, borderRadius: 12, background: '#2F4A2B', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>3</Text></Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#33352E', marginLeft: 12, flex: 1 }}>
              最近 3 条问诊摘要
            </Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingBottom: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 24, height: 24, borderRadius: 12, background: '#2F4A2B', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>4</Text></Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#33352E', marginLeft: 12, flex: 1 }}>
              星标优先的 8 条结论卡片
            </Text>
          </Box>

          <Box style={{
            background: '#FAF7EF', borderLeft: '4px solid #2F4A2B', paddingTop: 11, paddingBottom: 11,
            paddingLeft: 16, paddingRight: 16,
          }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#2F4A2B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
              token 靠三个上限恒定：历史 20 条 · 摘要 3 条 · 结论 8 条。
              <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>不随对话变长而失控。</span>
            </Text>
          </Box>

          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C0473C', marginTop: 16, marginBottom: 8 }}>
            为什么不用微调
          </Text>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#33352E', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
              · 微调改变的是"说话方式"，不是"记住某个人的过敏史"
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#33352E', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
              · 患者今早刚加的青霉素过敏，下午的对话必须带上 —— 只有提示词做得到
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#33352E', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
              · 一个家庭的数据量根本不支持训练，也不该把健康数据拿去训模型
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{
      position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 40,
      flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between',
      paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60,
    }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B8A7E' }}>广东医科大学 · MedAI</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#2F4A2B' }}>07 / 14</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
